<decision #track.add-eidolon-workflow-cli-authoring-commands.scope {
  status = "accepted"
  priority = "P0"
}
(
  <question ?>首版 `eidolon workflow` CLI 是否实现 actor-backed create/edit？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>暂不实现。</?>
    <decision-text ?>首版落地 deterministic `init/inspect/validate` 和 workflow roots injection；actor-backed create/edit 后续 track 继续。</?>
    <rationale ?>先保证 CLI 复用 component/service 和安全写入边界，再扩展 AI actor repair loop。</?>
    <evidence ?>mission design；track design。</?>
  )>
)>
